<plain>
<text x="304.8" y="27.94" size="2.54" layer="94">Stearns Flip Chip Tester</text>
<text x="381" y="7.62" size="2.54" layer="94">B</text>
<text x="27.94" y="53.34" size="1.778" layer="94">RasPi Connector</text>
<text x="12.7" y="50.8" size="1.778" layer="94">Warning: Pi is referenced to VCC/VSS, not GND!</text>
<text x="7.62" y="223.52" size="1.778" layer="94">M series (TTL):</text>
<text x="25.4" y="220.98" size="1.778" layer="94">2V/1.6mA == 1.25K</text>
<text x="25.4" y="223.52" size="1.778" layer="94">0.8V/16mA == 267</text>
<text x="7.62" y="218.44" size="1.778" layer="94">M111 needs 16 loads.</text>
<text x="7.62" y="177.8" size="1.778" layer="94">R series:</text>
<text x="7.62" y="172.72" size="1.778" layer="94">R107 needs 7 loads</text>
<text x="20.32" y="177.8" size="1.778" layer="94">-0.8V/18mA == 44</text>
<text x="20.32" y="175.26" size="1.778" layer="94">-3.2V/10mA == 320</text>
<text x="149.86" y="177.8" size="1.778" layer="94">S series:</text>
<text x="149.86" y="172.72" size="1.778" layer="94">S107 needs 7 loads</text>
<text x="162.56" y="177.8" size="1.778" layer="94">-0.8V/20mA == 40</text>
<text x="162.56" y="175.26" size="1.778" layer="94">-3.2V/10mA == 320</text>
</plain>
